# _build/ holds the site's build system -- the injectors Tim runs and the
# verified source data they read. It IS source and is tracked (2026-08-29):
# inject_daily_print.py now runs unattended every school morning, and an
# untracked generator has no history and no remote copy.
#
# The publish log is the one exception: Tim appends to it on every run but no
# injector declares it, so tracking it would leave a permanently uncommitted
# change in the working tree.
_build/publish-safety-log.md
